  "description": "<p>This task is to create a configuration class (ConfigurationProperties.java ?) that provides a means of:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>collecting the currently dispersed System Properties into a centralized utility class</li>\n\t<li>setting these properties either via Spring or System Properties</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The current System Properties that are used within the code base are found in the following classes:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>MetricsConfig.java</li>\n\t<li>StreamingBaseHtmlProvider.java</li>\n\t<li>FedoraBaseResource.java</li>\n\t<li>FedoraSessionImpl.java</li>\n\t<li>BNodeSkolemizationUtil.java</li>\n\t<li>RdfLexicon.java</li>\n\t<li>DefaultPropertiesLoader.java - this one can remain as it is</li>\n</ul>\n",
